A2. reference_models.arbitrarily_large_ax_core_discrete

Lean fields
- formal/ERIEC/RefModel/LargeCore.lean:103-117 LargeStableReferenceWitness: positive, dc,
  frame, total, dc_eq, frame_eq, three cardinalities, multivalued, hinge_nonempty,
